#. i18n: file: core/smb4k.kcfg:46
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowHiddenShares), group (UserInterface)
#: rc.cpp:42
msgid ""
"Hidden shares will be displayed in the network browser. Hidden shares are "
"ending with a $ sign, e.g. Musik$ or IPC$."
